OL,3,GNEWSACadet leader admits chats with
OL,4,Achildren 'unwise'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Army Cadets instructor accused of
OL,7,Fsexual offences accepted his
OL,8,Fconversations with his teenage accusers
OL,9,Fwere "unwise", a court has heard.
OL,11,FRylan Ray is on trial charged with 25
OL,12,Foffences, which he denies.
OL,14,FJurors were told that following his
OL,15,Ffirst arrest last year after two cadets
OL,16,Fcomplained, the 26-year-old, from
OL,17,FWestgate in Peterborough, refused to
OL,18,Fanswer most of the police's questions.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
