OL,3,GNEWSACadet leader admits chats with
OL,4,Achildren 'unwise'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at Ipswich Crown Court,
OL,7,Fprosecutor Claire Matthews read a
OL,8,Fsection of a statement given to police
OL,9,Fby Ray's solicitor at the time, in
OL,10,Fwhich he denied ever making an
OL,11,Funsolicited request for sexual photos.
